:\"语音助手\",\"orderNum\":4,\"params\":{},\"questionContent\":\"《第5课》语音识别技术的应用场景不包括以下哪一项？\",\"questionId\":218,\"questionScore\":2,\"questionType\":\"choice\",\"scoringItems\":[]},{\"answer\":\"D\",\"optionA\":\"噪音环境\",\"optionB\":\"发音清晰度\",\"optionC\":\"录音设备的质量\",\"optionD\":\"说话人的性别\",\"orderNum\":5,\"params\":{},\"questionContent\":\"《第5课》下列哪个因素不会影响语音识别的准确性？\",\"questionId\":217,\"questionScore\":2,\"questionType\":\"choice\",\"scoringItems\":[]},{\"answer\":\"B\",\"optionA\":\"将声音信号转换为音素\",\"optionB\":\"找出音素出现概率最高的词语\",\"optionC\":\"提供语音合成的功能\",\"optionD\":\"识别图像中的文字\",\"orderNum\":6,\"params\":{},\"questionContent\":\"《第5课》语言模型的主要作用是什么？\",\"questionId\":216,\"questionScore\":2,\"questionType\":\"choice\",\"scoringItems\":[]},{\"a', 0, NULL, '2026-03-13 14:47:50', 20);
