,\"optionA\":\"A. 麦克风\",\"optionB\":\"B. 条形码扫描器\",\"optionC\":\"C. 温度计\",\"optionD\":\"D. 摄像头\",\"orderNum\":4,\"params\":{},\"questionContent\":\"2.条形码识别技术的核心是通过什么设备获取信息？（  ）\",\"questionId\":407,\"questionScore\":10,\"questionType\":\"choice\",\"scoringItems\":[]},{\"answer\":\"B\",\"optionA\":\"A. 接触式\",\"optionB\":\"B. 非接触式\",\"optionC\":\"C. 只能有线\",\"optionD\":\"D. 只能无线\",\"orderNum\":5,\"params\":{},\"questionContent\":\"4.射频识别技术（RFID）的通信方式是（  ）\",\"questionId\":409,\"questionScore\":10,\"questionType\":\"choice\",\"scoringItems\":[]},{\"answer\":\"C\",\"optionA\":\"A. 条形码识别\",\"optionB\":\"B. 二维码识别\",\"optionC\":\"C. RFID技术\",\"optionD\":\"D. 人脸识别\",\"orderNum\":6,\"params\":{},\"questionContent\":\"5.高速公路ETC系统主要采用的识别技术是（', 0, NULL, '2026-03-16 13:05:34', 19);
